        "PMC11427457::web::002::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding a minor amount of zirconia or titania can enhance the thermal stability of multielement solid-solution nanoparticles at 773–1173 K.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7181682::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Zirconia and titania are suitable refractory metal-oxide dopants for this intervention.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide dopant will form a stabilizing shell around the nanoparticles.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternatively, the oxide dopant will decorate the nanoparticle surface.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide shell or surface decoration will reduce surface diffusion.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing surface diffusion will prevent particle coarsening.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide dopant will reduce the surface energy of the nanoparticles.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lower surface energy will reduce the thermodynamic driving force for Ostwald ripening and coarsening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Doped nanoparticles will coarsen less than untreated nanoparticles during high-temperature catalytic operation.",
